264
00:20:50,520 --> 00:20:52,260
No horns. Nothing.

265
00:20:54,260 --> 00:20:55,360
What a relief.

266
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:59,097
Your body temperature can't go
down because you're all bones.

267
00:20:59,180 --> 00:21:01,062
You're cold as a corpse already.

268
00:21:01,260 --> 00:21:02,180
I see.

269
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:04,480
That makes sense, yes.

270
00:21:04,860 --> 00:21:08,389
Why, I don't have any flesh or
organs for that matter, do I?

271
00:21:08,900 --> 00:21:11,820
Even a fatal illness is
no threat to a corpse.

272
00:21:16,160 --> 00:21:17,580
Wow, that is depressing.

273
00:21:17,960 --> 00:21:19,240
But I'm invincible.

274
00:21:20,900 --> 00:21:21,920
Wait a sec.

275
00:21:22,920 --> 00:21:27,097
Brooke is a skeleton, so his temperature
didn't change when he was infected.

276
00:21:27,180 --> 00:21:28,827
Also, the ice didn't spread.

277
00:21:29,580 --> 00:21:32,597
That means the virus must be
spreading through the ice.

278
00:21:32,680 --> 00:21:33,680
It's multiplying.

279
00:21:34,140 --> 00:21:36,700
It happens because their body gets cold.

280
00:21:37,380 --> 00:21:40,720
So then we have to
maintain their temperature.

281
00:21:41,480 --> 00:21:45,560
All right, but how is it freezing
their body from the inside?

282
00:21:46,940 --> 00:21:50,080
Maybe I was wrong about how it works.

283
00:21:50,300 --> 00:21:53,100
Chopper, your arm! What's happening?

284
00:21:56,360 --> 00:21:59,360
How did I not notice? Oh, no!

285
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:01,056
How did they get me?

286
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:04,380
All is lost!

287
00:22:04,800 --> 00:22:06,540
Summer's gonna die!

288
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:11,520
Special attack, Green Star!

289
00:22:12,220 --> 00:22:13,050
Shippo!

290
00:22:19,060 --> 00:22:21,060
Ew! Ew! Gross!

291
00:22:22,800 --> 00:22:23,920
Gotcha! Hell yeah!

292
00:22:24,280 --> 00:22:28,456
If you can't beat him, dissolve him
with digestive fluid, I always say!

293
00:22:30,440 --> 00:22:35,520
This stuff is nasty and
sticky, and I hate it!

294
00:22:35,780 --> 00:22:37,380
Help me, baby!

295
00:22:38,240 --> 00:22:40,440
Oh, baby!

296
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:48,020
You could've freed yourself, you whiner!

297
00:22:49,520 --> 00:22:50,380
No, baby!

298
00:22:54,500 --> 00:22:57,057
Oh, baby, you're my hero!

299
00:22:57,140 --> 00:23:01,660
Get off of me, you're
covered in slime, you maniac!

300
00:23:04,280 --> 00:23:05,980
Let's try this one!

301
00:23:16,700 --> 00:23:19,520
That attack was so basic.

302
00:23:27,140 --> 00:23:32,460
No more games, because I
am done playing around!

303
00:23:44,520 --> 00:23:45,440
Ultimortar!

304
00:23:45,680 --> 00:23:46,640
Not again.

305
00:24:00,600 --> 00:24:02,120
Hold on, Usopp.

306
00:24:03,340 --> 00:24:04,700
You're next, Tramp.

307
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:07,140
Don't kill me.

308
00:24:07,520 --> 00:24:11,360
I can't fight back. It's over.
You beat me. You won this.

309
00:24:11,520 --> 00:24:13,220
You totally defeated me.

310
00:24:13,400 --> 00:24:15,297
You think I don't know that already?

311
00:24:15,380 --> 00:24:17,640
You've wasted enough of my time.

312
00:24:18,240 --> 00:24:20,180
Now say it. Okay.

313
00:24:20,840 --> 00:24:22,300
What do I say?

314
00:24:22,520 --> 00:24:24,817
I told you loud and clear, didn't I?

315
00:24:24,900 --> 00:24:27,260
Your captain pissed me off,

316
00:24:27,360 --> 00:24:32,125
bragging about how he's going to beat
Commander Kaido and be King of the Pirates.

317
00:24:32,640 --> 00:24:34,680
I'm sorry, you're right.

318
00:24:35,060 --> 00:24:38,480
Luffy's an idiot, and he talks too much.

319
00:24:38,820 --> 00:24:41,660
Just don't headbutt me, I'm begging you.

320
00:24:42,340 --> 00:24:43,600
I'll do anything.

321
00:24:43,960 --> 00:24:45,254
I'll leave the island.

322
00:24:46,240 --> 00:24:48,877
If you hit me again, I'm done.

323
00:24:48,960 --> 00:24:50,060
I'll die.

324
00:24:50,300 --> 00:24:52,480
I'll give you one last chance.

325
00:24:52,800 --> 00:24:54,660
Say it loud and clear.

326
00:24:54,900 --> 00:24:58,920
SAY THAT YOUR CAPTAIN WILL
NEVER BE KING OF THE PIRATES!

327
00:25:04,920 --> 00:25:06,037
Fine.

328
00:25:06,120 --> 00:25:08,900
Luffy will...

329
00:25:15,160 --> 00:25:17,177
Luffy will...

330
00:25:17,260 --> 00:25:22,060
He'll never, never be able to...

331
00:25:24,420 --> 00:25:25,540
That's it, Nami.

332
00:25:25,940 --> 00:25:27,417
It's okay to lie.

333
00:25:27,500 --> 00:25:29,777
The truth isn't worth dying for.

334
00:25:29,860 --> 00:25:31,937
Not after we've come this far.

335
00:25:32,020 --> 00:25:35,180
Just lie to her, whatever it takes.

336
00:25:36,740 --> 00:25:38,257
Luffy will...

337
00:25:38,340 --> 00:25:42,177
Luffy will never...

338
00:25:42,260 --> 00:25:48,920
never give up till he wins.

339
00:25:52,060 --> 00:25:52,890
Ah!

340
00:25:52,973 --> 00:25:54,120
So I'm sorry!

341
00:25:55,720 --> 00:26:00,560
He'll beat Kaido, and he'll
become King of the Pirates!

342
00:26:04,180 --> 00:26:05,620
You had your chance.

343
00:26:05,960 --> 00:26:07,200
Now die.

344
00:26:09,940 --> 00:26:12,540
Get away, Nami, you dope! Hurry!

345
00:26:12,780 --> 00:26:13,880
Oh, Nami!

346
00:26:17,780 --> 00:26:18,610
Go!

347
00:26:18,693 --> 00:26:19,523
Tomachiya!

348
00:26:35,780 --> 00:26:37,320
It's Tama!

349
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:39,540
What are you doing here?
